---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Use"
  description="Terms for using the Charles Michael Sports Hub website."
>
  <section class="bg-navy text-white py-20 md:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <p class="section-subtitle text-red-brand">Using This Website</p>
      <h1 class="font-display font-black text-6xl md:text-8xl leading-none mb-6">Terms of Use</h1>
      <p class="font-body text-blue-100 text-xl max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
        These draft terms describe basic expectations for using the Charles Michael Sports Hub website.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-9">
      <div class="bg-bluegrey border-l-4 border-red-brand p-6 rounded-r-xl">
        <p class="font-body text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          <strong>Draft notice:</strong> These terms require review by CMSH and a qualified legal adviser before publication. They do not replace event rules, registration terms, or a participant waiver.
        </p>
      </div>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-3xl text-navy mb-3">Website information</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          The website provides general information about CMSH programmes and activities. Details such as fees, training schedules, event dates, venues, and availability may change. Confirm current arrangements directly with CMSH before relying on them.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-3xl text-navy mb-3">Appropriate use</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          Use this site lawfully and respectfully. Do not attempt to disrupt, damage, gain unauthorised access to, or misuse the site or its content. Do not use website content to mislead others about CMSH, its events, or its affiliations.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-3xl text-navy mb-3">Intellectual property</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          Unless otherwise stated, text and design on this site are provided by or for CMSH. Third-party names, marks, and linked resources remain the property of their respective owners. Ask CMSH for permission before reproducing its original material beyond uses allowed by law.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-3xl text-navy mb-3">External links and availability</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          Links to other websites are provided for convenience; CMSH does not control their content or privacy practices. We aim to keep this site available and accurate but cannot guarantee uninterrupted access or that every item of information is complete or current.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-3xl text-navy mb-3">Updates and contact</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          CMSH may update these terms as the site changes. These draft terms do not specify governing law, dispute procedures, or legal limitations; those provisions must be reviewed and confirmed before publication. Verified contact details will be added when available.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
